WEBVTT

01:40.020 --> 01:43.000
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.160 --> 01:45.850
[Episode 12]

01:47.940 --> 01:49.729
Kill Zhao Yuanzhou for me.

01:52.950 --> 01:53.840
Say

01:54.420 --> 01:55.370
yes.

01:58.670 --> 01:59.710
Yes.

02:10.669 --> 02:12.800
That was just an insignificant skill.

02:16.750 --> 02:17.420
Hey.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.090
What is this place?

02:20.470 --> 02:21.870
We were just lying

02:21.870 --> 02:23.130
in the coffins, right?

02:35.030 --> 02:36.890
Why are there so many dead people?

02:45.329 --> 02:46.829
Gosh!

02:47.230 --> 02:48.150
Break!

02:54.860 --> 02:56.190
It was just an illusion.

02:56.350 --> 02:57.310
It was fake.

02:57.790 --> 03:00.590
He was pulling my leg just now. It was really scary.

03:10.390 --> 03:12.090
I guess someone cast a spell

03:12.390 --> 03:13.790
on the wind chime,

03:13.830 --> 03:16.160
so that it can affect and bewitch people.

03:30.350 --> 03:31.170
They're here.

03:32.850 --> 03:33.900
Good archery.

03:34.840 --> 03:35.610
Awesome.

03:35.860 --> 03:37.060
-Awesome.
-Awesome.

03:37.710 --> 03:38.400
Let's go.

03:38.400 --> 03:38.990
Let's go.

03:39.300 --> 03:40.540
I'm here.

03:40.710 --> 03:41.470
Don't be afraid.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.270
Well,

03:42.640 --> 03:44.370
if only Mr. Zhuo were here.

03:50.070 --> 03:53.070
This is where the demonic energy in the town came from:

03:53.430 --> 03:54.829
Lingxi Villa.

03:56.610 --> 03:58.760
[God Bless Lingxi]

03:57.670 --> 03:58.930
There are demons here?

04:00.860 --> 04:02.120
There are demons here.

04:03.410 --> 04:04.830
There are demons here.

04:07.670 --> 04:08.670
Don't be afraid.

04:08.700 --> 04:09.900
Both of us are demons.

04:11.480 --> 04:13.290
A demon catching Mr. Zhuo

04:14.190 --> 04:16.450
is like a rat catching a cat, right?

04:17.000 --> 04:18.200
Looks like in this world,

04:18.200 --> 04:20.670
I'm not the only one who wants to commit suicide.

04:20.670 --> 04:21.600
Interesting.

04:24.260 --> 04:26.520
This is the only way to Mount Kunlun.

04:27.830 --> 04:28.940
But now,

04:29.150 --> 04:30.540
plague is rampant here,

04:30.530 --> 04:35.460
[God Bless Lingxi]

04:30.720 --> 04:32.650
and demonic energy is everywhere.

04:33.710 --> 04:35.070
And Zhuo is missing.

04:36.070 --> 04:36.970
Looks like someone

04:36.970 --> 04:39.030
doesn't want us to go to Mount Kunlun.

04:40.470 --> 04:41.270
But...

04:41.290 --> 04:42.940
few people know

04:43.510 --> 04:45.110
we're going to Mount Kunlun.

04:45.830 --> 04:47.890
How could we be ambushed by demons?

04:48.190 --> 04:49.440
Who is so annoying?

04:49.550 --> 04:51.150
The one who wants to destroy

04:51.150 --> 04:52.210
the Wilderness.

04:53.510 --> 04:54.480
Li Lun.

04:56.530 --> 04:58.780
[God Bless Lingxi]

04:56.790 --> 04:57.670
Hands off!

04:57.690 --> 04:58.290
Come here.

04:59.430 --> 05:01.150
It's improper for men and women to touch each other.

05:01.150 --> 05:02.870
It's not appropriate

05:03.020 --> 05:04.970
for you to hold Ms. Pei.

05:06.390 --> 05:07.920
What are you talking about?

05:07.920 --> 05:09.500
How old am I?

05:09.520 --> 05:11.500
Are you an idiot?

05:12.870 --> 05:14.540
If you hold Ms. Pei,

05:15.150 --> 05:17.010
she won't be able to shoot arrows.

05:17.280 --> 05:18.750
If we encounter a demon,

05:18.780 --> 05:20.580
she won't be able to protect you.

05:21.470 --> 05:23.230
Don't imitate Mr. Zhuo.

05:23.270 --> 05:24.750
Who is imitating Mr. Zhuo?

05:25.390 --> 05:26.150
Sorry.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.190
My bad.

05:27.510 --> 05:29.030
You should learn from him

05:29.030 --> 05:30.150
so that you can understand the differences between you two.

05:30.150 --> 05:30.950
Right?

05:31.070 --> 05:32.370
Sorry.

05:32.510 --> 05:34.020
Stop wasting time.

05:34.150 --> 05:35.610
Let's find Mr. Zhuo first.

05:35.909 --> 05:37.840
Zhuo is skilled in swordsmanship.

05:38.080 --> 05:39.220
Ordinary people

05:39.390 --> 05:41.380
can never catch him so easily.

05:43.030 --> 05:44.540
Is there a possibility

05:44.790 --> 05:47.240
that Mr. Zhuo wanted to be caught?

05:48.390 --> 05:50.390
Then he would definitely leave a clue.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.230
A clue?

05:51.510 --> 05:52.440
I'll look for it.

05:55.790 --> 05:57.240
You're not afraid now?

05:57.390 --> 05:58.190
Ying Lei,

05:58.400 --> 05:59.870
you have an acute sense of smell.

05:59.870 --> 06:00.310
Go.

06:00.330 --> 06:01.130
Okay.

06:03.710 --> 06:04.670
I found

06:04.990 --> 06:06.190
Brother Zhuo's bell.

06:07.090 --> 06:09.040
[God Bless Lingxi]

06:07.230 --> 06:08.170
Let me smell it.

06:08.410 --> 06:10.270
Smell it and see if there are more bells ahead.

06:10.270 --> 06:10.910
Go.

06:11.500 --> 06:12.430
This way.

06:13.150 --> 06:14.010
Go.

06:14.030 --> 06:14.640
This way.

06:14.770 --> 06:15.300
This way.

06:15.390 --> 06:16.380
Found it.

06:17.360 --> 06:17.950
This way.

06:17.950 --> 06:19.010
Not bad.

06:19.430 --> 06:20.630
Your nose works well.

06:31.560 --> 06:32.140
No more bells.

06:32.140 --> 06:32.940
No more bells?

06:33.240 --> 06:34.780
This is strange.

06:35.630 --> 06:37.670
It means there must be a secret tunnel here.

06:37.670 --> 06:38.909
Let's split up.

06:39.350 --> 06:39.990
Okay.

06:40.270 --> 06:42.200
You go over there. I'll go this way.

07:03.390 --> 07:04.430
It's...

07:04.430 --> 07:05.360
a prescription.

07:05.950 --> 07:07.160
Jiu, take a look.

07:09.280 --> 07:11.540
It's for promoting blood circulation, relieving stagnation,

07:11.540 --> 07:13.800
detoxifying, and clearing pestilence.

07:14.100 --> 07:15.760
It's for treating the plague?

07:20.200 --> 07:21.430
Why is a prescription

07:21.430 --> 07:23.090
for treating the plague here?

07:34.870 --> 07:35.670
Gosh!

07:35.670 --> 07:36.750
Why is it here?

07:36.750 --> 07:37.630
It's too scary!

07:37.630 --> 07:38.940
Why is this happening?

07:38.970 --> 07:39.820
It's too creepy!

07:39.820 --> 07:40.520
It's gone.

07:41.530 --> 07:42.520
It's gone.

07:42.550 --> 07:43.880
There is nothing there.

07:43.980 --> 07:44.980
See for yourself.

07:49.409 --> 07:50.210
It's gone.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.530
What's wrong?

07:58.060 --> 07:59.180
Xiao, behind you.

08:01.750 --> 08:02.950
What's wrong?

08:03.190 --> 08:04.190
Gosh!

08:04.470 --> 08:06.330
Xiao, there's a demon behind you.

08:07.410 --> 08:08.210
Don't move.

08:13.550 --> 08:15.160
There's a demon behind you.

08:15.750 --> 08:16.830
It's so scary.

08:16.990 --> 08:18.470
Why are you teasing Jiu?

08:18.520 --> 08:20.120
I will never come here again.

08:46.600 --> 08:48.270
Your friends are here.

08:51.130 --> 08:53.480
They will find me.

08:54.500 --> 08:55.460
Yes.

08:56.000 --> 08:58.390
So give them a warm welcome.

09:11.620 --> 09:12.960
Demon friend,

09:13.010 --> 09:15.070
you have a distinctive personality.

09:15.330 --> 09:16.660
What kind of demon is he?

09:16.860 --> 09:19.130
He should be... Fei.

09:19.190 --> 09:19.950
Fei?

09:20.080 --> 09:21.400
I learned from a book

09:21.630 --> 09:23.460
that this kind of demon can deplete water

09:23.460 --> 09:24.770
and wither grass.

09:25.000 --> 09:27.860
And its appearance would bring plague to the world.

09:28.030 --> 09:28.910
So you are the root cause

09:28.910 --> 09:31.270
of the plague in Sinan Water Town.

09:35.150 --> 09:37.030
But it seems

09:37.510 --> 09:38.870
he is without malice.

09:42.350 --> 09:44.710
Sister Pei, you've learned to observe demons

09:44.710 --> 09:46.410
and defend them now.

09:55.860 --> 09:56.840
Hello.

09:56.990 --> 09:58.860
Have you seen our friend?

10:07.750 --> 10:10.030
Maybe your description was not good enough,

10:10.030 --> 10:11.340
so he couldn't recognize him.

10:11.340 --> 10:12.500
Let me try.

10:14.140 --> 10:15.910
Have you seen our friend?

10:16.030 --> 10:17.990
He's in blue.

10:18.990 --> 10:19.790
He's not...

10:24.510 --> 10:25.970
He's not as handsome as me.

10:33.670 --> 10:34.350
Hello.

10:34.550 --> 10:35.950
Have you seen our friend?

10:36.520 --> 10:38.180
He's taller and more handsome

10:38.390 --> 10:39.830
than this great demon.

10:44.910 --> 10:46.190
Zhao Yuanzhou, see?

10:50.470 --> 10:51.390
Where is he?

10:56.520 --> 10:58.950
Why do you want Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core?

11:01.090 --> 11:02.790
Because I want freedom.

11:05.110 --> 11:07.170
What does Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core

11:07.180 --> 11:10.080
have to do with your freedom?

11:11.630 --> 11:14.490
There is a blood feud between you and Zhao Yuanzhou.

11:15.310 --> 11:17.550
How would you feel

11:17.550 --> 11:18.550
to be with someone

11:19.150 --> 11:20.830
who is your sworn enemy?

11:21.910 --> 11:23.320
Would you hate him?

11:26.470 --> 11:27.350
I...

11:30.820 --> 11:33.050
He killed your father and brother.

11:33.510 --> 11:35.850
He killed so many innocent people,

11:36.030 --> 11:37.780
but you can't kill him.

11:38.130 --> 11:39.990
And you have to face him every day.

11:41.910 --> 11:43.910
How can you not hate him?

12:06.080 --> 12:08.130
You should hate him.

12:09.190 --> 12:10.960
What's in this incense burner?

12:16.950 --> 12:18.300
This is Lingxi Villa.

12:18.450 --> 12:20.360
Of course it's a rhinoceros horn.

12:25.380 --> 12:26.700
Burning rhinoceros horns

12:26.700 --> 12:28.100
can connect Yin and Yang.

12:28.710 --> 12:32.510
It can help me attract the malicious energy in and outside the villa.

12:41.370 --> 12:42.490
Mr. Zhuo.

12:43.560 --> 12:45.690
Do you know what malicious energy is?

12:46.950 --> 12:49.130
Hatred in this world

12:49.160 --> 12:50.990
transforms into malicious energy.

12:50.990 --> 12:53.540
It's natural sustenance for fierce beasts.

12:54.050 --> 12:55.820
It can also awaken the hatred and pain

12:55.820 --> 12:57.180
deep in your heart.

12:59.190 --> 13:00.310
Come on.

13:00.610 --> 13:02.810
Listen to the hatred deep in your heart.

13:03.190 --> 13:05.920
Let it tell you what to do.

13:22.520 --> 13:24.360
Kill him.

13:53.240 --> 13:54.690
It's dark in the secret tunnel.

13:54.690 --> 13:56.230
Let's use the Baize Divine Power

13:56.230 --> 13:58.140
to explore it.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.030
As a great demon,

14:09.510 --> 14:11.770
you actually need my power

14:12.150 --> 14:13.750
to feel the barrier?

14:16.150 --> 14:18.030
Actually, I can do it myself.

14:20.070 --> 14:22.530
Just say it if you want to hold Xiao's hand.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.830
How old are you?

14:26.830 --> 14:28.010
You already understand this kind of thing?

14:28.010 --> 14:30.280
I remember I first knew what love is

14:30.380 --> 14:32.770
when I was 370 years old.

14:33.710 --> 14:34.760
Zhao Yuanzhou.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.740
Go to jail.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.630
Let's go.

14:44.390 --> 14:45.190
Let's go.

14:45.360 --> 14:45.950
Let's go.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.190
What's wrong?

15:09.750 --> 15:12.410
Our route here has been completely blocked off.

15:23.310 --> 15:25.070
Kill him.

15:32.680 --> 15:34.460
You scared me.

15:34.790 --> 15:35.870
Friend,

15:36.310 --> 15:37.850
why are you so mysterious?

15:59.270 --> 16:00.350
What is this?

16:05.760 --> 16:07.630
In a world plagued by a disease,

16:07.740 --> 16:10.540
Qing Geng Goddess used red pigments

16:10.620 --> 16:12.350
to dye Jinli stones

16:12.690 --> 16:14.090
and gave them to everyone

16:14.240 --> 16:15.640
to ensure their safety.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.180
The people on the mural

16:20.210 --> 16:22.010
also have the red bead bracelet.

16:27.660 --> 16:29.450
Qing Geng Goddess?

16:31.010 --> 16:33.400
Everybody wants to be a goddess.

16:33.820 --> 16:36.620
Do they really think it's very easy to be a goddess?

16:37.240 --> 16:39.070
I learned from a book

16:39.100 --> 16:41.580
that Qing Geng lives on cypress trees,

16:42.210 --> 16:43.790
living off their flowers and fruits.

16:43.790 --> 16:46.190
It does have the ability to ward off plague.

16:46.740 --> 16:47.850
Qing Geng...

16:48.190 --> 16:50.330
can only protect herself from plague.

16:51.030 --> 16:52.150
In fact,

16:52.150 --> 16:53.890
she is just an ordinary demon.

16:54.200 --> 16:55.870
I saw her in the Wilderness before.

16:55.870 --> 16:58.670
She was always flying in the forest.

16:59.790 --> 17:01.190
She was noisier than Jiu.

17:01.530 --> 17:02.820
How can a small sparrow

17:03.790 --> 17:05.510
be called a goddess?

17:11.150 --> 17:13.089
Most so-called deities exist

17:13.950 --> 17:16.750
merely to satisfy people's desires.

17:18.190 --> 17:19.650
When they want something,

17:20.980 --> 17:22.829
they turn to deities.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.760
But when a calamity strikes,

17:26.710 --> 17:28.450
they would complain

17:28.990 --> 17:30.790
that deities are unresponsive,

17:31.150 --> 17:32.430
nature is merciless,

17:33.340 --> 17:34.710
and all beings suffer.

17:36.310 --> 17:38.970
Then they would do bad things without guilt

17:39.160 --> 17:40.240
and shift the blame

17:40.830 --> 17:43.640
to those imagined deities.

17:49.190 --> 17:51.890
If everyone wearing this bead died,

17:53.040 --> 17:55.580
it was not for warding off the plague.

17:55.910 --> 17:57.000
Could it be...

17:57.200 --> 17:59.460
But there's only an ordinary mural here.

18:00.070 --> 18:01.310
There is no exit.

18:03.470 --> 18:04.030
Fei.

18:08.100 --> 18:08.750
Fei?

18:11.110 --> 18:12.240
He's so mysterious.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.370
Since Qing Geng

18:17.400 --> 18:19.260
wants to be a goddess desperately

18:19.660 --> 18:21.030
and wants everyone

18:21.050 --> 18:22.580
to worship her as a goddess,

18:23.750 --> 18:25.500
let's just do it.

18:25.830 --> 18:26.430
What?

18:35.600 --> 18:36.670
Goddess, you...

18:56.800 --> 18:57.330
Let's go.

18:58.820 --> 19:00.420
We don't know what's inside.

19:00.810 --> 19:01.670
Zhao Yuanzhou,

19:02.050 --> 19:02.890
you go first.

19:02.990 --> 19:04.320
I'll follow in the rear.

19:07.430 --> 19:07.990
Let's go.

19:20.540 --> 19:21.470
Wen!

19:21.470 --> 19:22.070
Goddess!

19:22.100 --> 19:22.830
Great Demon!

19:22.990 --> 19:24.090
Open the door!

19:24.430 --> 19:26.840
So, is what you found an exit

19:27.110 --> 19:28.150
or a trap?

19:30.550 --> 19:31.880
Whatever it is,

19:31.900 --> 19:33.320
we can only move forward.

19:33.950 --> 19:34.750
Come on.

19:35.380 --> 19:36.800
Protect me.

19:37.150 --> 19:38.410
Or we'll die together.

19:39.720 --> 19:40.470
Of course.

19:43.430 --> 19:44.730
Open the door!

19:45.750 --> 19:47.120
Why won't it open?

19:47.680 --> 19:49.010
Sister Pei, pray...

19:50.420 --> 19:51.950
The door is not responding.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.470
It won't

19:53.470 --> 19:54.060
open.

19:54.190 --> 19:54.920
Is it broken?

19:58.830 --> 19:59.870
Sister Pei!

19:59.990 --> 20:00.870
Sister Pei, what's wrong?

20:00.870 --> 20:01.540
Sister Pei!

20:04.590 --> 20:05.230
Gosh!

20:05.630 --> 20:07.480
Sister Pei, you have been infected with the plague!

20:07.480 --> 20:08.270
The plague?

20:29.690 --> 20:30.930
Zhuo.

21:12.080 --> 21:13.380
Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:13.830 --> 21:14.740
Zhuo.

21:59.590 --> 22:00.260
Zhuo.

22:00.260 --> 22:01.080
Don't come near us!

22:01.080 --> 22:02.270
He's being controlled by malicious energy.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.670
He's very dangerous now.

22:05.850 --> 22:08.310
Why is there so much malicious energy on you?

22:08.770 --> 22:10.400
I'm going to kill you.

22:11.950 --> 22:14.330
We share the same thought and are like-minded.

22:14.330 --> 22:15.990
But you can't do it now.

22:19.510 --> 22:20.450
Don't move.

22:21.080 --> 22:22.010
I'm helping you.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.870
I'm going to kill you.

22:25.040 --> 22:26.770
I promised you long ago, right?

22:27.640 --> 22:29.150
But not now.

23:32.350 --> 23:34.630
It's you, an evil bird.

23:45.050 --> 23:46.650
I've heard a lot about you,

23:46.710 --> 23:47.670
Zhu Yan.

23:48.430 --> 23:49.760
After seeing you today,

23:50.190 --> 23:53.250
I think you truly are as insufferable as the rumor says.

24:00.840 --> 24:03.080
In order to control the malicious energy on him,

24:03.080 --> 24:05.410
you must have used a lot of demonic power.

24:08.650 --> 24:10.380
I have plenty of demonic power.

24:11.770 --> 24:13.280
I know that.

24:13.810 --> 24:15.030
But you can't restore it

24:15.030 --> 24:16.110
within a short time,

24:16.110 --> 24:16.910
can you?

24:18.860 --> 24:20.150
I didn't expect

24:20.330 --> 24:22.780
the famous evil demon

24:22.800 --> 24:25.430
to hurt himself in order to save someone.

24:26.110 --> 24:27.030
Zhu Yan,

24:27.550 --> 24:30.220
I didn't know you have such a kind heart.

24:33.060 --> 24:34.470
The person I want to save

24:35.150 --> 24:36.420
is not just someone.

24:36.800 --> 24:38.290
He's my good friend.

24:39.940 --> 24:42.000
You consider him as your good friend.

24:42.560 --> 24:44.360
But what does he consider you as?

24:45.600 --> 24:46.710
Zhuo Yichen,

24:46.760 --> 24:48.890
who is the man standing in front of you?

24:50.030 --> 24:51.790
My sworn enemy.

24:55.070 --> 24:56.930
What should you do when your enemy

24:57.230 --> 24:58.760
is standing in front of you?

25:00.880 --> 25:02.160
I should kill him.

25:06.400 --> 25:07.480
Zhuo.

25:08.960 --> 25:10.060
Zhuo.

25:16.470 --> 25:18.180
What exactly do you want?

25:19.670 --> 25:21.470
I want your inner core.

25:23.450 --> 25:24.610
You have one.

25:25.430 --> 25:27.060
Why do you want mine?

25:28.780 --> 25:30.060
In this world,

25:30.110 --> 25:31.810
only your inner core

25:32.210 --> 25:34.660
can destroy the seal of the Baize Token.

25:39.790 --> 25:42.520
I want to break the Baize seal on me

25:44.300 --> 25:46.060
and regain freedom.

25:49.230 --> 25:50.110
Seal?

25:52.350 --> 25:54.410
Because of this damn seal,

25:55.170 --> 25:56.470
I've been trapped in Lingxi Villa

25:56.470 --> 25:58.670
and I can never go out.

25:59.890 --> 26:02.180
Baize Goddess was so cruel.

26:10.050 --> 26:11.350
Zhuo Yichen,

26:11.450 --> 26:12.520
what are you waiting for?

26:12.520 --> 26:13.740
Kill him!

26:24.510 --> 26:25.380
Zhuo.

26:26.820 --> 26:27.810
Zhuo!

26:37.630 --> 26:38.800
Zhuo!

27:31.510 --> 27:34.710
The malicious energy and demonic energy here are really strong.

27:34.710 --> 27:36.340
They even blinded me.

27:36.500 --> 27:39.560
I didn't realize there is a seal of the Baize Token.

27:42.230 --> 27:45.150
You two were acting to trick me?

27:45.220 --> 27:46.100
No.

27:46.430 --> 27:47.660
I was not acting.

27:47.910 --> 27:49.680
My fear was real.

27:49.830 --> 27:51.440
Mr. Zhuo's Cloud Light Sword

27:51.550 --> 27:52.780
is really scary.

27:53.550 --> 27:54.980
I am scarier.

27:55.150 --> 27:56.260
Do you want to try?

27:57.030 --> 27:57.590
Okay.

27:58.570 --> 28:00.830
When did you regain your consciousness?

28:05.400 --> 28:06.200
Don't move.

28:06.440 --> 28:07.370
I'm helping you.

28:08.400 --> 28:10.200
I'm going to kill you.

28:10.460 --> 28:11.390
I promised you long ago,

28:11.390 --> 28:12.070
right?

28:12.900 --> 28:14.420
But not now.

28:38.170 --> 28:39.150
Let me kill...

28:39.900 --> 28:41.410
You've regained your consciousness, right?

28:41.410 --> 28:42.820
Why do you still look stupid?

28:42.820 --> 28:44.130
You're the stupid one!

28:44.310 --> 28:46.260
Don't you want to know Qing Geng's real purpose?

28:46.260 --> 28:47.730
Do what you're good at.

28:48.230 --> 28:49.070
Now?

28:50.070 --> 28:51.350
I don't think it's a good time.

28:51.350 --> 28:52.150
Acting.

28:53.070 --> 28:54.640
I meant acting.

28:55.430 --> 28:55.990
Oh.

28:57.590 --> 28:59.690
Are you sure you are not taking this opportunity to settle personal grudges?

28:59.690 --> 29:00.900
No!

29:02.550 --> 29:03.470
Mr. Zhuo,

29:03.910 --> 29:04.700
are you

29:05.070 --> 29:06.310
ready?

29:06.340 --> 29:07.210
Shut up!

29:10.600 --> 29:11.840
What a pity.

29:12.630 --> 29:15.360
Indeed, the seal of the Baize Token can be broken.

29:15.820 --> 29:18.520
But it requires me to use the malicious energy

29:18.870 --> 29:20.510
to cast the spell myself.

29:21.590 --> 29:22.680
If I die,

29:23.010 --> 29:25.610
it'll be useless even if you have my inner core.

29:26.230 --> 29:28.790
The one who tricked you into taking my inner core

29:28.790 --> 29:31.060
is either a fool or a liar.

29:33.710 --> 29:36.160
You're a liar.

29:37.750 --> 29:39.450
In this world,

29:40.060 --> 29:41.720
no one believes in sincerity.

29:42.270 --> 29:44.130
Hypocritical people always win.

29:47.990 --> 29:48.830
Forget it.

29:49.670 --> 29:51.930
I just want to know who tricked you

29:52.390 --> 29:54.730
into taking my inner core.

30:00.720 --> 30:02.850
I can guess it even if you don't tell me.

30:03.300 --> 30:05.500
There is a loathsome and familiar smell

30:05.650 --> 30:07.460
on you.

30:11.690 --> 30:12.890
-Wen Xiao!
-Wen Xiao!

30:47.750 --> 30:48.590
So hot.

30:54.710 --> 30:55.690
Your hand...

30:55.950 --> 30:57.160
It really hurts.

30:58.310 --> 31:00.040
I meant that thing on your hand.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.440
It's the plague.

31:14.670 --> 31:15.930
Wen Xiao.

31:22.150 --> 31:22.920
Zhuo!

31:34.310 --> 31:35.270
Jiu,

31:35.300 --> 31:36.510
stay away from me.

31:37.510 --> 31:38.150
Yes.

31:38.310 --> 31:38.990
Come.

31:40.030 --> 31:41.590
Stay away from her.

31:42.350 --> 31:43.270
I'm half-god and half-demon.

31:43.270 --> 31:44.750
I have the bloodline of the God Race.

31:44.750 --> 31:45.680
I should be fine.

31:45.710 --> 31:46.230
Well,

31:46.750 --> 31:48.100
I'm fine too.

31:49.120 --> 31:50.240
That's strange.

31:54.910 --> 31:55.780
No.

31:55.820 --> 31:57.140
She's having a high fever.

31:57.140 --> 31:58.640
We need to get out of here as soon as possible.

31:58.640 --> 31:59.870
Otherwise, she'll be in danger.

31:59.870 --> 32:00.510
Okay.

32:00.900 --> 32:03.040
Even if I have to break my knife,

32:03.150 --> 32:04.920
I'll dig a tunnel and crawl out.

32:05.990 --> 32:06.590
Eh?

32:11.130 --> 32:11.940
Fei?

32:16.810 --> 32:17.620
Qing Geng?

32:25.540 --> 32:26.540
What Qing Geng?

32:27.410 --> 32:29.540
Isn't the one he was helping Qing Geng?

32:29.750 --> 32:30.720
Are you sure?

32:30.950 --> 32:31.590
Yes.

32:31.610 --> 32:33.700
She looks exactly the same as the one on the mural.

32:33.700 --> 32:35.290
Take care of Sister Pei here.

32:35.290 --> 32:35.880
Hey.

32:35.920 --> 32:36.680
Bai Jiu!

32:37.230 --> 32:37.640
Hey.

32:53.650 --> 32:54.900
Don't come near me!

32:57.190 --> 32:58.540
I don't need you to save me

32:58.540 --> 32:59.850
or help me.

33:22.400 --> 33:22.990
Gosh!

33:23.070 --> 33:23.950
You're hurt.

33:26.760 --> 33:27.420
Let me do it.

33:27.460 --> 33:28.470
I'm a doctor.

33:35.870 --> 33:37.390
Why do you want to save me?

33:40.270 --> 33:41.570
My master always said

33:41.600 --> 33:43.000
doctors are benevolent.

33:43.620 --> 33:45.220
We can't just let people die.

33:56.610 --> 33:58.440
Doctors are benevolent.

34:00.190 --> 34:01.690
If I tell you

34:02.770 --> 34:05.700
I am the culprit who spread the plague,

34:06.820 --> 34:08.449
will you still save me?

34:10.409 --> 34:12.409
Actually, I've already guessed it.

34:13.699 --> 34:14.350
You spread the plague

34:14.350 --> 34:17.040
through those red bead bracelets, right?

34:21.320 --> 34:23.000
That red bead...

34:24.210 --> 34:25.960
was stained with Fei's blood.

34:28.980 --> 34:30.520
Why did you do that?

34:40.460 --> 34:42.280
Do you know I was

34:42.469 --> 34:44.920
a goddess worshipped by everyone?

34:47.150 --> 34:48.659
I've lived in this town

34:48.690 --> 34:50.130
for a few hundred years.

34:51.110 --> 34:53.070
People worshipped me

34:53.360 --> 34:54.659
and prayed to me

34:55.280 --> 34:56.429
that I could protect them

34:56.429 --> 34:57.700
from the plague.

34:59.220 --> 35:01.090
Their piety and faith

35:01.110 --> 35:02.380
gave me strength.

35:03.080 --> 35:05.000
So I blessed them

35:05.020 --> 35:06.180
and protected them.

35:07.150 --> 35:08.460
It was like

35:09.030 --> 35:11.330
feeling guilty for receiving their gifts

35:11.330 --> 35:12.750
and wanting

35:13.050 --> 35:15.260
to give them something in return.

35:18.730 --> 35:20.180
But one day,

35:20.350 --> 35:22.000
Fei came here.

35:23.750 --> 35:26.210
He is the origin of plague by nature.

35:27.050 --> 35:28.600
I did everything I could,

35:29.190 --> 35:31.790
but I still couldn't stop the calamity.

35:32.620 --> 35:34.230
Please save us.

36:09.980 --> 36:12.770
Many people died due to the plague.

36:13.490 --> 36:16.130
The survivors vented their anger

36:17.770 --> 36:19.440
and called me a liar

36:19.760 --> 36:20.760
and a fake god.

36:22.130 --> 36:24.510
They destroyed Lingxi Villa

36:25.040 --> 36:26.990
and splashed dirty water

36:27.010 --> 36:28.200
and filthy things

36:28.470 --> 36:29.550
on my statue.

36:30.250 --> 36:32.630
No one wanted to believe me

36:33.020 --> 36:34.280
or worship me anymore.

37:14.430 --> 37:15.930
Shortly afterwards,

37:16.460 --> 37:18.310
Baize Goddess also came.

37:29.930 --> 37:31.860
She realized Fei causes plague,

37:32.550 --> 37:34.630
while Qing Geng can ward off plague.

37:35.510 --> 37:37.780
I'm the natural enemy of Fei.

37:38.960 --> 37:41.430
In order to suppress Fei's plague miasma,

37:42.750 --> 37:44.540
Baize Goddess

37:44.160 --> 37:48.020
[Lingxi Villa]

37:44.620 --> 37:45.670
sealed us

37:45.670 --> 37:47.830
in Lingxi Villa.

37:50.000 --> 37:51.360
I've been sealed here

37:51.360 --> 37:52.690
for a few hundred years.

37:54.630 --> 37:55.950
I can't

37:56.340 --> 37:57.750
see the end of it.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.810
You are a mortal

38:03.100 --> 38:04.580
and a young boy.

38:05.830 --> 38:07.270
Your life is short.

38:08.320 --> 38:11.180
You can't understand this kind

38:11.470 --> 38:13.690
of endless suffering.

38:16.630 --> 38:18.290
Someone told me

38:19.160 --> 38:21.710
as long as I spread the plague

38:22.460 --> 38:24.020
to lure you here,

38:24.090 --> 38:25.850
kill Zhao Yuanzhou,

38:26.070 --> 38:27.720
and get his inner core,

38:28.510 --> 38:30.870
I could break the Baize seal

38:31.270 --> 38:32.570
and leave here.

38:43.090 --> 38:44.380
Brother Zhuo.

38:49.470 --> 38:51.530
I know the person you just mentioned.

38:51.790 --> 38:52.870
His name is Li Lun.

38:54.210 --> 38:55.320
Right?

39:01.780 --> 39:02.710
Qing Geng,

39:03.770 --> 39:05.290
you spread the plague

39:05.670 --> 39:07.260
to harm the mortal world.

39:07.330 --> 39:08.860
Do you confess to the crime?

39:11.640 --> 39:12.920
It was not her fault.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.200
It was all my fault.

39:14.550 --> 39:15.660
Because of me,

39:16.080 --> 39:18.610
she was sentenced to life imprisonment here.

39:18.990 --> 39:20.190
So you can speak?

39:24.310 --> 39:25.450
If I were her,

39:27.020 --> 39:29.350
I would also resent fate for being unfair.

39:44.850 --> 39:46.580
I have a way to treat the plague.

39:46.680 --> 39:48.750
As long as you help me save her,

39:49.780 --> 39:51.500
I'll help you save everyone.

39:52.380 --> 39:53.770
Really?

39:59.190 --> 40:01.300
But she's badly injured.

40:01.750 --> 40:03.950
I'm afraid even deities can't save her.

40:06.060 --> 40:07.750
If we were somewhere else,

40:07.950 --> 40:09.650
I'm afraid she couldn't be saved.

40:09.650 --> 40:10.730
But here,

40:11.500 --> 40:13.000
maybe I can give it a try.

40:13.910 --> 40:15.190
You have a way?

40:16.160 --> 40:17.500
Because of the plague,

40:18.040 --> 40:20.880
Sinan Water Town is surrounded by malicious energy.

40:20.880 --> 40:23.010
The stronger the malicious energy is,

40:23.430 --> 40:25.230
the greater my demonic power is.

40:26.160 --> 40:28.540
I can try to use the malicious energy here

40:29.030 --> 40:30.170
to treat her.

41:17.190 --> 41:18.280
Thank you...

41:21.350 --> 41:22.450
for saving her.

41:27.300 --> 41:28.900
She is very important to you?

41:33.840 --> 41:34.870
Yes.

41:37.270 --> 41:38.320
Very important.

41:39.570 --> 41:41.990
I've been cursed by fate since I was born.

41:42.140 --> 41:43.580
Wherever I go,

41:42.360 --> 41:46.410
[Glorious Flowers in Spring and Solid Fruits in Autumn]

41:43.900 --> 41:45.100
plague arises.

41:45.950 --> 41:47.350
Both humans

41:47.710 --> 41:48.810
and demons

41:49.910 --> 41:52.040
consider me the source of calamity,

41:53.310 --> 41:54.150
fearing

41:55.320 --> 41:56.310
me.

42:23.280 --> 42:24.600
But she's different.

42:26.520 --> 42:28.740
She could have been

42:28.850 --> 42:30.330
a Qing Geng bird

42:31.720 --> 42:34.300
flying freely in the clear sky.

42:50.740 --> 42:52.600
I yearned to go to the mortal world

42:53.960 --> 42:56.960
and didn't want to be sealed in the barren Wilderness.

43:02.310 --> 43:03.560
So

43:04.390 --> 43:06.650
I escaped from the Wilderness secretly.

43:18.790 --> 43:21.320
The mortal world is prosperous and bustling.

43:21.340 --> 43:22.450
Grass, trees,

43:23.190 --> 43:24.590
flowers, and leaves

43:25.070 --> 43:27.110
are full of vitality.

43:30.320 --> 43:32.020
Only in the mortal world

43:32.650 --> 43:35.040
do I truly feel alive.
